name: Oops Pile x3 + Lucky Cat
author: nat + lola
description: >
  Three separate Oops! All 6s across antes 1-6, plus Lucky Cat anywhere in the
  same run. Oops luck stacks 2^n per OopsPile's own math — two copies is 4x,
  three is 8x baseline rarity, so this stacks 8x on top of Lucky Cat's own hunt.
  Red White, no gimmick decks.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]
    min: 3
  - joker: LuckyCat
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]
should:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]
    score: 10
    label: oops
  - joker: LuckyCat
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]
    score: 5
    label: cat

seeds: []
